{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmsee2p1ilk0","created":1794401912922,"text":"贝叶斯分类器"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseeidqqao0","created":1794401947067,"text":"贝叶斯决策论"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseeqrvjyg0","created":1794401965336,"text":"贝叶斯公式：P(c|x)=P(c)P(x|c)/{P(x)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefbavaz40","created":1794402010020,"text":"先验概率 P(c)：类别本身概率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseffr6k3s0","created":1794402019715,"text":"后验概率 P(c|x)：给定样本，属于c的概率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefjkjh480","created":1794402028019,"text":"条件似然 P(x|c)：类别c下出现样本x的概率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefpwqjio0","created":1794402041817,"text":"最小错误率准则：选择后验最大的类别（MAP）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefu1478o0","created":1794402050789,"text":"风险最小化：考虑不同错分代价（条件风险）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsertydhi00","created":1794402990993,"text":"极大似然估计 MLE"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmses7u234g0","created":1794403021207,"text":"思想：找参数，让数据集出现概率最大"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseu3n769k0","created":1794403168814,"text":"优缺点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseua4vmrk0","created":1794403182944,"text":"优点：简单，将概率估计转化为优化问题；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseuhj73kw0","created":1794403199047,"text":"缺点：高度依赖假设的分布形式，如果假设的分布和真实数据分布不符，估计结果很差；受样本噪声影响大。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmseul9l4000","created":1794403207173,"text":"区分：MLE 是频率学派；贝叶斯估计会给参数加先验分布。"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}